# Allowlist: ignore everything, then include only Apps Script source files.
**/*
!**/
!appsscript.json
!**/*.js
!**/*.gs
!**/*.html

# Defense in depth for local-only and generated content.
**/node_modules/**
**/docs/**
**/test/**
**/tests/**
**/fixtures/**
**/package.json
**/package-lock.json
**/client_secret_*.apps.googleusercontent.com.json
**/.clasp.json
**/.clasprc*.json
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*~
